      description: 'State of the 25 sources read by the "Domain" rules (21 tables). A source is a table, or part of a logged table: for example SecurityEvent \xB7 file access (4656, 4660, 4663, 4670). For each one: table present or not, fed in the window, events actually collected (audit policy, data collection rule), missing columns used by the rules, and whether another source of the same family compensates. Run it first on a new environment: a missing source raises no error, it only returns empty results.',
