      description: "Devices, accounts and processes that contacted the domain (DeviceNetworkEvents), downloaded a file from the domain (DeviceFileEvents, origin or referrer) or mentioned it in a command line (DeviceProcessEvents). In Sentinel, Sysmon (22 DNS queries, 3 connections, with the process), workstations seen by the proxy (ASimWebSessionLogs, CommonSecurityLog, without process) and Azure Firewall (AZFWApplicationRule, AZFWDnsQuery: source IP only, without device name or process) complete Defender for Endpoint. MachineRole gives the known role of the device, AccountKind the category of the account (system, service).",
      reading: {
        decisive: "Non-browser process (powershell, mshta, curl, rclone, node) contacting the domain.",
        context: "File downloaded from the domain then executed on the same device.",
        noise: "Browsers loading third-party resources of the page."
      },
