      description: "Devices, paths and names under which the file appears, with the actions seen (written, executed, loaded), the originating accounts and processes. Defender for Endpoint, completed in Sentinel by ASIM normalized files and processes and by Sysmon (1 process, 7 DLL loaded, 15 file stream, 23 and 26 delete, 29 executable detected). MachineRole gives the known role of the device (DC, declared server). The HOST context narrows the search to one device.",
